    "body": "Maintainer decisions (question dialog, 2026-11-13), after the review of PR #1426:\n\n1. **Runner scope: \"Collaborators only\".** Only PRs written by a collaborator of NeoTech/Camcraft are sent to the self-hosted runner. A PR from any other account builds locally in the reviewer's worktree, as today. The workflow also refuses a diff that touches `xtask/`.\n2. **Isolation: \"Separate runner/user\".** PR tests run on a runner with its own label and its own OS user (own HOME, cargo home and sccache directory). The cut pipeline (#1413) never uses that runner or its caches.\n\nStill to fix on PR #1426 from the review: the refusal list must match nested `.cargo/` directories, and the diff must be listed with `--no-renames`.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
